sub('jobs-and-storage.md',"Only `packages/nl2sql/src/nl2sql/storage/` imports `chromadb` and `sqlite3`.","Outside the adapters, only `packages/nl2sql/src/nl2sql/storage/` imports `sqlite3`, and only it imports `chromadb` (the local embedding model borrows chromadb's embedding function, not its index).")
sub('dashboards-and-saved-answers.md',"`propose_tiles` is read-only and runs nothing.","`propose_tiles` is read-only: it runs no query and saves nothing, and only for the third source makes one model call.")
